-q
----------------------------------------------------------------------
10 CLS
20 B% = 3
30 C% = 5
40 D% = 6
50 E% = 0
60 F% = -1
' AND truth table, on variables so that nothing is folded
70 A% = E% AND E%
75 PRINT "0", A%
80 A% = E% AND F%
85 PRINT "0", A%
90 A% = F% AND E%
95 PRINT "0", A%
100 A% = F% AND F%
105 PRINT "-1", A%
' AND works bit by bit, it is not a boolean operation
110 A% = 3 AND 5
115 PRINT "1", A%
120 A% = B% AND C%
125 PRINT "1", A%
130 A% = 3 AND C%
135 PRINT "1", A%
140 A% = B% AND 5
145 PRINT "1", A%
' Priorities: AND is more priority than OR, but less than the comparisons
150 A% = B% AND C% OR D%
155 PRINT "7", A%
160 A% = B% = 3 AND C% = 5
165 PRINT "-1", A%
' Special cases with a constant operand: reduced by the compiler with a warning
170 A% = 0 AND B%
175 PRINT "0", A%
180 A% = B% AND 0
185 PRINT "0", A%
190 A% = -1 AND B%
195 PRINT "3", A%
200 A% = B% AND -1
205 PRINT "3", A%
----------------------------------------------------------------------
WARNING: at 31:12 line 170 - AND operation with 0 reduced to 0; consider to remove the useless AND
WARNING: at 33:13 line 180 - AND operation with 0 reduced to 0; consider to remove the useless AND
WARNING: at 35:13 line 190 - AND operation with -1 reduced to no operation; consider to remove the useless AND
WARNING: at 37:13 line 200 - AND operation with -1 reduced to no operation; consider to remove the useless AND
